Looks good! You've placed the center column and the two horizontal green blocks correctly extensions on both sides. Now we move on to the next layer.

1. **Horizontal Extensions:** Place green blocks to the left and right of the leftmost and rightmost green blocks in the current layer.
    - One should be placed left of the leftmost green block;
    - Another one should be placed right of the rightmost green block;
    - Both of these new blocks should be placed directly below the existing columns with green blocks spanning 3 blocks long, to the left and right of the center block. So reference the 2 green blocks you just placed and double that horizontally to each side with a new block each.

Once you have these blocks in place, confirm and we'll proceed with the next part.

